    "kind": "function",
    "signature": "fn scan_row_schema() -> schema::SchemaRef",
    "docs": "Get the base schema that scan rows (from [`Scan::scan_metadata`]) will be returned with.\n\nThis is the base shape; engines may add trailing `*_parsed` columns by opting in via\n[`StatsOptions`] (`stats_parsed`) or [`PartitionValuesOptions`] (`partitionValues_parsed`).\n\nIt is:\n```ignored\n{\n   path: string,\n   size: long,\n   modificationTime: long,\n   stats: string,\n   deletionVector: {\n     storageType: string,\n     pathOrInlineDv: string,\n     offset: int,\n     sizeInBytes: int,\n     cardinality: long,\n   },\n   fileConstantValues: {\n     partitionValues: map<string, string>,\n     tags: map<string, string>,\n     baseRowId: long,\n     defaultRowCommitVersion: long,\n     clusteringProvider: string,\n   }\n}\n```",
